This folder contains the ethernet BFM testbench.
From this directory

run_sim

In eth_bfm_tb.sv packets can be generated randomly or from a packet file by 
changing the packet_from_file variable. The number of random packets can be 
changed with num_pkts. The number of file packets is currently restricted to
one until a standard file format is determined.

The packet class contained in the receiver env directory can be modified
to generate different types of random or fixed packets using its constraints.




